{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1620730/extras/86a58b56411a61d1e3140313cb507a76.poster.avif?t=1768404475\" width=614 height=2680 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1620730/extras/86a58b56411a61d1e3140313cb507a76.webm?t=1768404475\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1620730/extras/86a58b56411a61d1e3140313cb507a76.mp4?t=1768404475\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Hell is Us is a 3rd-person action-adventure game that combines intense melee combat with the thrill of exploration. Explore a semi-open world to find answers to your questions and face mysterious creatures all along your journey.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >A HOSTILE WORLD</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >As well as the civil war dividing the country, the region is suffering from a mysterious calamity, which has given rise to supernatural creatures that no modern weapon can defeat. Your drone and sword from a different age are your faithful allies as you cut a path through lands infested with terrifying chimeras and try to unravel the mystery of their appearance.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >A UNIQUE EXPLORATION SYSTEM</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >No map, no compass, no quest markers: following your instincts is part of the adventure. Enjoy a unique experience that uses innovative writing and level design to let you make your own decisions and follow your instincts as you explore. Your discoveries are yours alone.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >COMBAT AGAINST ORIGINAL CREATURES</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Swords, spears and axes: a wide range of weapons forged specially for fighting these supernatural creatures is available. You will need to learn how to fight these monsters and use your drone wisely to stay alive.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >''The central theme of Hell is Us is that human violence is a perpetual cycle fueled by human emotions and passions.'' \u2013 Jonathan Jacques-Bellet\u00eate, Creative Director</p>","achievements":{"highlighted":[{"name":"So It Begins","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/1620730/c698e233aa6c39312b93745d4fdbcba8bf84cbde.jpg"},{"name":"Emotional Baggage","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/1620730/5841b70709c4f57c4b9542a3494673df04b80b74.jpg"},{"name":"Redemption","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/1620730/a5a74855c7f93fc10e252787f3277c42b9cd5849.jpg"},{"name":"Good Samaritan","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/1620730/8a79669222568c70b9e20a813fedc80680d42c28.jpg"},{"name":"Man of the People","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/1620730/5ad74fad6ae0ceda562d08db06e8a6caaff28fc7.jpg"},{"name":"End the Suffering","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/1620730/61f9ea52245e2bea9683c9b4f7a26cf47f8e31a4.jpg"},{"name":"Amateur Detective","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/1620730/d9314c97361b2059a6f3ccfe80f2d842753c2c12.jpg"},{"name":"Super-Sleuth","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/1620730/b1c7cd1670a58002a27a2715992d84d7da5e4945.jpg"},{"name":"All the Rage","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/1620730/432fde6aff6be1ef71df1be530e8acd89893d7de.jpg"},{"name":"Buzz Killer","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/1620730/71802fc65671b2c5ea47d9ccd9984cf0dd0b1d66.jpg"}],"total":40},"background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/1620730?t=1768404475","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1620730/93ce65c6600d49af48d2efff64531ac15ebfaaea/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1768404475","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1620730/98e4f03b30ee333cd17ae612beca44dc50cccb1b/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1768404475","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1620730/98e4f03b30ee333cd17ae612beca44dc50cccb1b/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1768404475","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Steam Achievements","id":22},{"description":"Full controller support","id":28},{"description":"Camera Comfort","id":67},{"description":"Color Alternatives","id":66},{"description":"Custom Volume Controls","id":68},{"description":"Adjustable Difficulty","id":78},{"description":"Playable without Timed Input","id":74},{"description":"Stereo Sound","id":69},{"description":"Subtitle Options","id":65},{"description":"Surround Sound","id":70},{"description":"Steam Cloud","id":23},{"description":"HDR available","id":61},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[1,2,5],"notes":"This game depicts strong violence, blood, bad language and suggestive themes."},"controller_support":"full","detailed_description":"<h1>DELUXE EDITION</h1><p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1620730/extras/2fbc146e3732951bcbec7230867c5afb.avif?t=1768404475\" width=615 height=1503 /></span></p></p><br><h1>About the Game</h1><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1620730/extras/86a58b56411a61d1e3140313cb507a76.poster.avif?t=1768404475\" width=614 height=2680 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1620730/extras/86a58b56411a61d1e3140313cb507a76.webm?t=1768404475\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1620730/extras/86a58b56411a61d1e3140313cb507a76.mp4?t=1768404475\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Hell is Us is a 3rd-person action-adventure game that combines intense melee combat with the thrill of exploration. Explore a semi-open world to find answers to your questions and face mysterious creatures all along your journey.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >A HOSTILE WORLD</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >As well as the civil war dividing the country, the region is suffering from a mysterious calamity, which has given rise to supernatural creatures that no modern weapon can defeat. Your drone and sword from a different age are your faithful allies as you cut a path through lands infested with terrifying chimeras and try to unravel the mystery of their appearance.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >A UNIQUE EXPLORATION SYSTEM</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >No map, no compass, no quest markers: following your instincts is part of the adventure. Enjoy a unique experience that uses innovative writing and level design to let you make your own decisions and follow your instincts as you explore. Your discoveries are yours alone.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >COMBAT AGAINST ORIGINAL CREATURES</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Swords, spears and axes: a wide range of weapons forged specially for fighting these supernatural creatures is available. You will need to learn how to fight these monsters and use your drone wisely to stay alive.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >''The central theme of Hell is Us is that human violence is a perpetual cycle fueled by human emotions and passions.'' \u2013 Jonathan Jacques-Bellet\u00eate, Creative Director</p>","developers":["Rogue Factor"],"dlc":[3494380,3494390,3494370,3494340,2912150,3494350],"genres":[{"description":"Action","id":"1"},{"description":"Adventure","id":"25"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1620730/7d40fd2849a6b259ee4de2b77dd643e9306104aa/header.jpg?t=1768404475","is_free":false,"legal_notice":"\u00a92025 Nacon. \u00a92025 Published by Nacon and developed by Rogue Factor. All rights reserved.","linux_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>"},"mac_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>"},"movies":[{"dash_av1":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/1620730/1065640170/4a66e2d188cd3b7b9a26f8bd7888dd1e47ca626e/1756821902/dash_av1.mpd?t=1756972850","dash_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/1620730/1065640170/4a66e2d188cd3b7b9a26f8bd7888dd1e47ca626e/1756821902/dash_h264.mpd?t=1756972850","highlight":true,"hls_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/1620730/1065640170/4a66e2d188cd3b7b9a26f8bd7888dd1e47ca626e/1756821902/hls_264_master.m3u8?t=1756972850","id":257192217,"name":"Launch Trailer","thumbnail":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/257192217/48051eef0ce9315ec9ad7786d897e5cd8027e870/movie_600x337.jpg?t=1756972850"},{"dash_av1":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/1620730/488162081/c04531e1678254a67e8fe6532defe96b32c8c191/1755682320/dash_av1.mpd?t=1755853466","dash_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/1620730/488162081/c04531e1678254a67e8fe6532defe96b32c8c191/1755682320/dash_h264.mpd?t=1755853466","highlight":true,"hls_h264":"https://video.aka