iption":"If war is the closest we get to hell on earth, it's because Earth harbours the worst of demons: humankind. In an isolated country ravaged by infighting, discover the secrets of your past and deal with the repercussions of a mysterious calamity.","steam_appid":1620730,"support_info":{"email":"support@nacon.fr","url":""},"supported_languages":"English<strong>*</strong>, French<strong>*</strong>, Italian, German, Spanish - Spain, Japanese, Korean, Polish, Portuguese - Brazil, Russian, Simplified Chinese, Turkish<br><strong>*</strong>languages with full audio support","type":"game","website":"https://hell-is-us.com/"}